@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title S01-structured-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: ManagementController" as ctl
participant "svc: ManagementService" as svc
participant "auth: AuthorizationService" as auth
participant "repo: Store" as repo
participant "audit: AuditService" as audit
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. addRoleInheritance(actor, seniorId, juniorId)
activate ctl
ctl -> svc: 2. inherit(actor, senior, junior, true)
activate svc
group local write transaction: lock before grant reads
svc -> auth: 3. lock()
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 4. center(actor, rbac:role:edit)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 5. root(actor)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 6. captureUpper(actor)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 7. protectRole(actor, seniorRole)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 8. protectRole(actor, juniorRole)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> repo: 9. one(RoleHierarchy.class, predicate, senior, junior)
activate repo
deactivate repo
note over svc
reachable(junior, senior): DFS queries outgoing edges.
Self / cross-system / duplicate / cycle throws BizException and aborts interaction.
end note
alt legal new edge
svc -> repo: 10. save(edge)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> svc: 11. changedUpper(actor, seniorRole)
activate svc
deactivate svc
note over auth
upper compares captured pre-mutation actor snapshot,
not the newly modified self grants.
end note
else invalid graph
svc --> obj: BizException; rollback
end
note over svc
finish: Store.flush → preserveAdministrator → g.version++
end note
svc -> audit: 12. success(actor, operation, target)
activate audit
deactivate audit
end
note over svc
Transaction proxy commits only normal return.
Any exception aborts: no edge/version/SUCCESS fact persists.
end note
deactivate svc
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml